---
title: Italian Cream Soda
image: https://tidymom.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/Italian-Sodas.jpg
time required: 2 minutes
servings: 1
---

Add @ice{1%handful} to your service cup. Then add @flavored syrup{1%oz}(4 Torani pumps) of your choice, @sparkling water or club soda{5%oz}, and @half and half or milk{1.5%oz}. Stir gently until combined. Top with @?whipped cream{} as desired.